  "content": "\n\n<p>這是適用於 (Neo)Forge 的沉浸式傳送門模組。 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">這是 Fabric 版本</a>.</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>本描述檔底部有「重要注意事項與常見問題」專區。請撥冗閱讀。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>透過傳送門相互觀望，並實現無載入畫面的無縫穿梭。</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2021/05/12/UlJ3zdESNyZWmxG.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>其他功能：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fPortals%2523end-portals\" rel=\"nofollow\">強化終界傳送門</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fPortals%2523mirrors\" rel=\"nofollow\">鏡子</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fPortal-Customization\" rel=\"nofollow\">建立自訂傳送門指令</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fDatapack-Based-Custom-Portal-Generation\" rel=\"nofollow\">基於數據包的自訂傳送門生成</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fPortals%2523world-wrapping-portal\" rel=\"nofollow\">世界環繞</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fDimension-Stack\" rel=\"nofollow\">維度堆疊</a></li>\n<li>更多資訊請參見 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基 (Wiki)</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>依賴項目：</h3>\n<p>此模組的 <strong>1.14 與 1.15</strong> 版本需依賴 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixinbootstrap\" rel=\"nofollow\">MixinBootstrap</a>。</p>\n<p>此模組所有 <strong>1.19 之後的版本</strong> 皆需依賴 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>聯繫方式：</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/qouteall/ImmersivePortalsModForForge/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報問題</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BZxgURK\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>重要注意事項與常見問題：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不建議使用 MC 1.16.x 的版本，因為該版本已嚴重過時，且無法與 Forge 的動態維度功能相容。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>新增模組時，務必備份您現有的世界（存檔）。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>問</strong>：我在使用此模組時遇到了問題，該怎麼辦？ <br><strong>答</strong>：請參考上方的聯繫方式，在 GitHub 上開立 Issue，或是在我們的 Discord 伺服器 #help-forge-version 頻道留言。</li>\n<li><strong>問</strong>：[MC 版本] 什麼時候出？ <br><strong>答</strong>：準備好就會推出！請不要再詢問了，我清楚每個新 MC 版本的發布時間。</li>\n<li><strong>問</strong>：支援哪些 MC 版本？ <br><strong>答</strong>：請參閱下方的支援矩陣：</li>\n</ul>\n<table style=\"width:97.3881%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<th style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.5676%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.14.4</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.4324%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.15.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.5676%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.16.5</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.4324%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.18.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.5676%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.19.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:5.81081%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.19.3</th>\n<th style=\"width:5.81081%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">🦊1.20.4</th>\n<th style=\"width:4.72973%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">🦊1.21.1</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">開發中</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">🚧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">支援中</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">✅</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">&nbsp;✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">僅依需求修復</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">僅接受 Pull Request</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">&nbsp;🔀</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">🔀</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">停止支援</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">⚠️</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">⚠️</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">⚠️</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">⚠️</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>注意：</strong></span> 支援矩陣中未提及且早於最新支援版本的模組版本，<strong>明確表示不會推出</strong>。所有晚於最新提及版本的版本<strong>仍在評估中</strong>。<strong>請不要再詢問這些版本的事宜</strong>。標註 🦊 的版本皆為 NeoForge 版本。</p>",
